    "detailed_description": "Prop Game is the perfect place to have fun with your friends!<br>Host a game and invite them to compete in crazy mini-games, solo or in teams!<br>You can play as a chair, a hat, a magnet, a staircase, a bottle and much more!<br>Who will be the best and win the most games? It's up to you!<br><br>You'll be controlling a random object with arcade-style physics, where even moving will be a challenge.<br>You can run into your friends to eject them, eliminate them to be the last survivor or to score points!<br><br>You'll be able to play as<br>- a chair<br>- a bottle<br>- a glass<br>- a hammer<br>- a magnet<br>- a saucepan<br>- a torch<br>- a staircase<br>- a hat<br>- a chalice<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479580/extras/e7361e91d92c38f216e071adb8cf7a35.avif?t=1688732270\" /></span><br><br>Various mini-games are available such as:<br>- TNT run<br>- Be the last to own the crown<br>- Obstacle course<br>- Team football<br>- Capture the flag<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2479580/extras/810701bf8b595665f929aa27360ba577.avif?t=1688732270\" /></span><br><br>In each mini-game you can, or rather you can try to:<br>- Move forward<br>- Go backwards<br>- Go left<br>- Go right<br>- jump",
